    "heading": "Attunement",
    "lineStart": 12863,
    "lineEnd": 12865
  },
  "section": "8.17",
  "rulesText": "Some magic items require a creature to form a bond - called Attunement - with them before the creature can use an item's magical properties. A creature can have Attunement with no more than three magic items at a time. See also “Equipment” (“Magic Items”)."
}
